# 🚖 Ola/Uber Ride Cancellation & Surge Pricing Analysis

## 📌 Project Overview

This project focuses on analyzing ride cancellation patterns, surge pricing behavior, customer dissatisfaction, and driver performance in ride sharing platforms like Ola and Uber.

The objective is to identify:
- Why rides are getting cancelled
- Peak booking demand hours
- High surge pricing locations
- Driver availability issues
- Revenue generating areas
- Customer dissatisfaction causes

The project is developed using:
- Excel
- SQL
- Python
- Power BI

---

# 🎯 Business Problem

Ride sharing companies face operational challenges such as:
- High ride cancellation rates
- Driver shortages
- Traffic delays
- Peak hour demand imbalance
- Customer dissatisfaction
- Surge pricing complaints

This analysis helps improve:
- Ride completion rate
- Customer experience
- Driver allocation
- Revenue optimization

